        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hamiltonian Mechanics and Phase Space",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  STEP 1: CANONICAL MOMENTA\n  pᵢ = ∂L/∂q̇ᵢ   (n equations)"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md#008",
      "path": [
        "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics, git-history:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics]",
        "canonical_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "concepts": "[hamiltonian, mechanics]",
        "current_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:variational-calculus:hamiltonian-mechanics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "variational-calculus",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[hamiltonian, mechanics]",
        "section": "variational-calculus",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hamiltonian Mechanics and Phase Space",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP 2: INVERT (if possible)\n  Express q̇ᵢ = q̇ᵢ(q, p, t) from the p equations.\n  Requires: ∂²L/∂q̇ᵢ∂q̇ⱼ nonsingular (Hessian invertible)."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics, git-history:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics]",
        "canonical_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "concepts": "[hamiltonian, mechanics]",
        "current_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:variational-calculus:hamiltonian-mechanics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "variational-calculus",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[hamiltonian, mechanics]",
        "section": "variational-calculus",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hamiltonian Mechanics and Phase Space",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP 3: LEGENDRE TRANSFORM\n  H(q, p, t) = Σᵢ pᵢ q̇ᵢ − L(q, q̇, t)\n  where q̇ on the right is expressed as a function of (q,p)."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics, git-history:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics]",
        "canonical_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "concepts": "[hamiltonian, mechanics]",
        "current_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:variational-calculus:hamiltonian-mechanics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "variational-calculus",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[hamiltonian, mechanics]",
        "section": "variational-calculus",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hamiltonian Mechanics and Phase Space",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLE: L = ½m|q̇|² − V(q)\n  p = mq̇  →  q̇ = p/m\n  H = p·(p/m) − [½m|p/m|² − V] = |p|²/2m + V(q)  ← Kinetic + potential!"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics, git-history:variational-calculus:05-hamiltonian-mechanics]",
        "canonical_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "concepts": "[hamiltonian, mechanics]",
        "current_path": "variational-calculus/05-HAMILTONIAN-MECHANICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:variational-calculus:hamiltonian-mechanics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "variational-calculus",
        "remap_from": "[]",
