      "text": "ENERGY CONSERVATION:\n  dH/dt = Σ (∂H/∂qᵢ q̇ᵢ + ∂H/∂pᵢ ṗᵢ) + ∂H/∂t\n        = Σ (∂H/∂qᵢ ∂H/∂pᵢ − ∂H/∂pᵢ ∂H/∂qᵢ) + ∂H/∂t\n        = ∂H/∂t"
