      "text": "DERIVATION from Lagrangian:\n  d/dt(H) = d/dt(Σpᵢq̇ᵢ − L) = Σ(ṗᵢq̇ᵢ + pᵢq̈ᵢ − ∂L/∂qᵢq̇ᵢ − ∂L/∂q̇ᵢq̈ᵢ − ∂L/∂t)\n  Use E-L: ṗᵢ = ∂L/∂qᵢ, and pᵢ = ∂L/∂q̇ᵢ → terms cancel.\n  = −∂L/∂t = ∂H/∂t  ■\n```"
